<mj-text font-size="22px" line-height="30px" font-weight="bold" color="#0b0b0f">Your hold on a client request ends soon</mj-text>
<mj-text>Hello,</mj-text>
<mj-text>Your 24-hour hold on a client request ends at {{claimExpiresAt}}.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Send the client a quote before then, or the request goes back to other lawyers and you won't see it again.</mj-text>
